1
00:01:22,480 --> 00:01:23,280
Great, great.

2
00:01:23,560 --> 00:01:24,600
Thanks to this hero.

3
00:01:24,600 --> 00:01:25,480
Great martial arts skills.

4
00:01:25,480 --> 00:01:26,610
Really impressive.

5
00:01:28,560 --> 00:01:29,620
What great skills.

6
00:01:29,640 --> 00:01:30,680
Indeed.

7
00:01:32,360 --> 00:01:33,840
You ignored the drowning child,

8
00:01:33,840 --> 00:01:35,120
and dragged me, the rescuer, ashore instead.

9
00:01:35,120 --> 00:01:36,580
What are your intentions?

10
00:02:14,600 --> 00:02:15,400
Jingxuan.

11
00:02:16,760 --> 00:02:18,160
Jingxuan, I found out.

12
00:02:18,440 --> 00:02:19,360
The girl's surname is Tang.

13
00:02:19,360 --> 00:02:21,160
She is a pipa instructor at the Jiaofangsi.

14
00:02:21,160 --> 00:02:23,160
You just returned from your patrol

15
00:02:23,160 --> 00:02:24,120
and haven't reported back yet.

16
00:02:24,120 --> 00:02:25,720
If you break into the Jiaofangsi now,

17
00:02:25,720 --> 00:02:27,920
aren't you giving Prince Yu leverage against you?

18
00:02:27,920 --> 00:02:30,640
Don't worry, I'll have someone keep an eye on her.

19
00:02:30,640 --> 00:02:31,700
She won't get away.

20
00:02:32,280 --> 00:02:33,340
I have my own plans.

21
00:02:46,000 --> 00:02:47,320
His Majesty's verbal decree.

22
00:02:47,320 --> 00:02:50,280
Prince Shuo has rendered meritorious service in inspecting river affairs.

23
00:02:50,280 --> 00:02:52,720
A music troupe from the Jiaofangsi is granted to enter his mansion.

24
00:02:52,720 --> 00:02:53,800
Respect this.

25
00:02:57,440 --> 00:02:59,000
My goodness.

26
00:03:08,960 --> 00:03:09,760
Miss Tang,

27
00:03:11,160 --> 00:03:12,680
your room is over here.

28
00:03:13,280 --> 00:03:14,280
Please follow me.

29
00:03:45,600 --> 00:03:48,000
Your Highness, Miss Tang has been settled.

30
00:03:48,480 --> 00:03:49,280
Understood.

31
00:03:51,000 --> 00:03:54,280
Your Highness, I don't know if I should say this.

32
00:04:00,160 --> 00:04:02,890
Right? You also think they look alike, don't you?

33
00:04:04,080 --> 00:04:05,740
It's not that they look alike.

34
00:04:05,760 --> 00:04:06,800
She is her.

35
00:04:09,000 --> 00:04:09,880
You may leave.

36
00:04:10,720 --> 00:04:12,240
Yes, Your Highness.

37
00:04:39,840 --> 00:04:43,120
The furnishings in this room are elegant and luxurious.

38
00:04:44,560 --> 00:04:47,020
It shouldn't be a place for me to live, right?

39
00:05:08,320 --> 00:05:09,280
Your Highness.

40
00:05:09,280 --> 00:05:11,800
This servant didn't know it was Your Highness.

41
00:05:11,800 --> 00:05:12,960
I have offended you.

42
00:05:13,280 --> 00:05:14,960
Please forgive me.

43
00:05:15,240 --> 00:05:16,840
This servant kowtows to you.

44
00:05:19,640 --> 00:05:21,080
Tang Zhiluo,

45
00:05:21,080 --> 00:05:23,400
why are you pretending not to know me?

46
00:05:23,400 --> 00:05:26,280
When did Your Highness go to the Jiaofangsi?

47
00:05:28,600 --> 00:05:30,320
How were your eyes cured?

48
00:05:32,320 --> 00:05:33,320
Where is the scar?

49
00:05:45,040 --> 00:05:47,300
Even if you want to pretend not to know me,

50
00:05:47,880 --> 00:05:49,480
you don't have to go this far.

51
00:05:49,840 --> 00:05:53,480
It's clearly Your Highness who is making things difficult for this servant.

52
00:05:53,480 --> 00:05:54,409
'This servant'?

53
00:05:56,240 --> 00:05:58,170
You were never this humble before.

54
00:06:00,320 --> 00:06:03,640
This servant only met Your Highness once by the river.

55
00:06:03,640 --> 00:06:05,440
I dare not claim any connection.

56
00:06:12,080 --> 00:06:16,080
Tang Zhiluo, I've been looking for you for two whole years.

57
00:06:23,760 --> 00:06:28,000
I don't care if you reincarnated or came back from the dead.

58
00:06:28,680 --> 00:06:32,280
I don't care if you really don't remember or are just pretending.

59
00:06:32,360 --> 00:06:33,159
I beg you,

60
00:06:34,920 --> 00:06:36,760
don't ever leave me again.

61
00:06:44,840 --> 00:06:45,700
Your Highness.

62
00:06:46,840 --> 00:06:47,560
What is it?

63
00:06:49,120 --> 00:06:50,120
Prince Yu is here.

64
00:06:51,480 --> 00:06:52,280
Understood.

65
00:07:02,600 --> 00:07:04,600
You will still live here from now on.

66
00:07:06,640 --> 00:07:07,680
Since you left,

67
00:07:08,880 --> 00:07:11,080
everything here has remained the same.

68
00:07:14,080 --> 00:07:15,610
Let's go back to how we were,

69
00:07:15,840 --> 00:07:16,760
okay?

70
00:07:18,720 --> 00:07:20,250
We can't fight him head-on.

71
00:07:24,640 --> 00:07:25,800
I'll be right back.

72
00:07:39,240 --> 00:07:41,120
Prince Shuo is crazy and eccentric,

73
00:07:41,120 --> 00:07:42,560
just as the rumors say.

74
00:07:43,440 --> 00:07:45,680
I must find a way to leave the mansion.

75
00:08:02,280 --> 00:08:03,800
Please wait, Miss Tang.

76
00:08:05,600 --> 00:08:09,260
Miss Tang, I didn't expect your medical skills to be so excellent,

77
00:08:09,520 --> 00:08:11,920
and your pipa playing to be so outstanding.

78
00:08:12,560 --> 00:08:14,920
It's as delicate as pearls falling on a jade plate,

79
00:08:14,920 --> 00:08:17,280
and as powerful as ten thousand galloping horses.

80
00:08:17,280 --> 00:08:18,000
Wonderful.

81
00:08:18,360 --> 00:08:19,240
Wonderful.

82
00:08:19,240 --> 00:08:20,440
You flatter me, sir.

83
00:08:21,280 --> 00:08:23,840
Miss, this is our Prince Yu.

84
00:08:24,800 --> 00:08:28,000
So it is the gentle and wise Third Prince.

85
00:08:28,920 --> 00:08:30,580
I pay my respects to Prince Yu.

86
00:08:31,080 --> 00:08:33,679
I didn't expect Your Highness to be so fond of music.

87
00:08:33,679 --> 00:08:36,039
Miss Tang is my sixth brother's woman.

88
00:08:36,720 --> 00:08:38,600
There's no need to be so polite to me.

89
00:08:38,600 --> 00:08:41,159
Just call me Third Brother as he does.

90
00:08:41,360 --> 00:08:43,200
What do you mean, Prince Yu?

91
00:08:44,120 --> 00:08:46,000
I am just a humble musician.

92
00:08:46,320 --> 00:08:49,050
How dare I presume to associate with Prince Shuo?

93
00:08:49,320 --> 00:08:50,850
Your Highness, you know me?

94
00:08:52,960 --> 00:08:53,760
Oh.

95
00:08:54,920 --> 00:08:55,880
I see.

96
00:08:56,560 --> 00:08:57,840
My sixth brother

97
00:08:58,400 --> 00:09:00,000
is truly infatuated.

98
00:09:07,800 --> 00:09:09,520
Why does Prince Yu know me?

99
00:09:15,000 --> 00:09:16,660
The back door is also guarded.

100
00:09:16,720 --> 00:09:18,580
Third Brother, you are rambling.

101
00:09:18,760 --> 00:09:20,490
What exactly do you want to say?

102
00:09:21,000 --> 00:09:23,360
Sixth Brother, you miss an old friend.

103
00:09:23,400 --> 00:09:24,930
But new clothes are better,

104
00:09:25,280 --> 00:09:26,880
and old friends are the best.

105
00:09:27,280 --> 00:09:28,400
People who look alike in this world

106
00:09:28,400 --> 00:09:29,440
are countless.

107
00:09:30,200 --> 00:09:31,880
You can't take them all into your mansion.
